# Ship bar

Read the repository `WORKFLOW.md`.

1. Branch from the current default branch.
2. Commit and push only intended changes.
3. Open a draft PR against the default branch; never stack.
4. Require deterministic repository CI plus `bot-feedback-gate`.
5. Treat review vendors and Qwen/local-LLM as advisory.
6. Read all feedback, post one plan, disposition and resolve every substantive thread.
7. Run `npm run pr:arm-and-park -- --pr <n>` once; never bypass its base guard.
8. Deploy or restart the merged default branch.
9. Run the repository verification command and report current evidence.

Agents do not use `--watch` or sleep-poll loops.
